sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 02.03.2020 passed in MVC.No.986/2017 by II Additional Senior Civil Judge and Additional Motor Accident Claims Tribunal,
Shviamogga, is modified;

- 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:2161 iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.26,09,200/- as against Rs.17,84,000/-;
iv) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid by the respondent-Insurance Company with interest at 6% per annum, within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
v) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact.

